.TH SDL_RemoveTimer 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_RemoveTimer \- Remove a timer created with
.BR SDL_AddTimer ().

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_timer.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_RemoveTimer(SDL_TimerID id);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I id
the ID of the timer to remove\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_AddTimer (3)
